    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fold space to cheat your way through puzzles.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.poster.avif?t=1755193251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.webm?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.mp4?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Break the rules of geometry and this game's mechanics</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Discover a variety of gameplay mechanics and break them in delightful ways with space folding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.poster.avif?t=1755193251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.webm?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.mp4?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Every puzzle is a star in the sky</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master space manipulation to reach beyond the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/162c16f765c375cc2c0bfaaeb74ec356.poster.avif?t=1755193251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/162c16f765c375cc2c0bfaaeb74ec356.webm?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/162c16f765c375cc2c0bfaaeb74ec356.mp4?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what lies at the end of the universe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/e90eef3bd05adbd644d93584cebbb054.poster.avif?t=1755193251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/e90eef3bd05adbd644d93584cebbb054.webm?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/e90eef3bd05adbd644d93584cebbb054.mp4?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.  Solve mind bending puzzles utilizing a space bending mechanic in game breaking ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.  Reach the end of the universe and uncover the mystery of your existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Enjoy relaxing graphics and a chill soundtrack.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fold space to cheat your way through puzzles.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.poster.avif?t=1755193251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.webm?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/2064a043ea5ccd13d8d32d6c0780c9a3.mp4?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Break the rules of geometry and this game's mechanics</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Discover a variety of gameplay mechanics and break them in delightful ways with space folding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.poster.avif?t=1755193251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.webm?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664840/extras/0a2d7506b730477e05d97cb4c68914d7.mp4?t=1755193251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Every puzzle is a star in the sky</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master space manipulation to reach beyond the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste